    "https://jobs.aston.ac.uk/Logon/": {
      "title": "Login/Register",
      "description": "Login - Jobs at Aston Skip to main content Login Register Current Vacancies Working at Aston Human Resources Website Terms of Use Contact Us Cookies Accessibility Search Jobs Jobs Aston Home Login Register More ▼ Cookies This site requires the use of cookies as defined by our Terms and Conditions . \n        We have provided a detailed description of how cookies work and are used on the site . \n        To accept cookies, please click the \"Accept Cookies\" button. Accept Cookies Login/Register To submit an application for a vacancy at Aston University you must register to access the secure online application submission procedure. During the registration process personal information will be collected which will also be used to help complete some of the application procedure. During registration you will also be given the opportunity to create a password which will allow you to log back onto the site, along with your email address, to either finish and submit  an incomplete application and to see a list of your current applications to Aston University. If you have already registered to access the online submission procedure you may logon again by entering your email address and the password you created during registration to access your secure information and submit an application for a vacancy at Aston University. If you have not previously registered, you will need to do so to make an online application, simply follow the registration option below to complete the registration process. Already Registered? Email/Username: Password: I accept cookies Login Not Registered? Proceed to the registration process. Register Forgotten Password? If you have forgotten your password, you can reset your password by following our password reset procedure. \n          You will be emailed a link which you must follow to be able to reset your password. Reset Password Jobs Current Vacancies Working at Aston Human Resources Website Terms of Use | Contact Us | Cookies | Accessibility © 2026 Aston University"
