      "description": "Current Vacancies - Jobs at Aston Skip to main content Login Register Current Vacancies Working at Aston Human Resources Website Terms of Use Contact Us Cookies Accessibility Search Jobs Jobs Aston Home Login Register More ▼ Cookies This site requires the use of cookies as defined by our Terms and Conditions . \n        We have provided a detailed description of how cookies work and are used on the site . \n        To accept cookies, please click the \"Accept Cookies\" button. Accept Cookies Current Vacancies Our current vacancies are grouped together into categories below. Select your preferred sort order to see the vacancies in which you are interested. Just click on the individual job links for further information about the post, the closing date and to make an online application. Sort by: Category Department Show: All Jobs Full Time Part Time Temp Filter Administrative & Clerical (2) Campus Support (2) Managerial & Professional (8) Teaching & Research (14) Full list of current vacancies (26) If you can't find a vacancy at the moment, please use our email service to be alerted to vacancies in the future. Login Please note: Javascript must be enabled to use this website. Email / Username: Password: I accept cookies Login Forgotten Details Register Find Jobs Jobs by Email Jobs by RSS Search Jobs: Search Advanced Job Search Latest Vacancies Deputy Director (Mktg & Rec) Reader in Aerospace Professor in Aerospace and Future Flight View All Vacancies Jobs Current Vacancies Working at Aston Human Resources Website Terms of Use | Contact Us | Cookies | Accessibility © 2026 Aston University"
