    "https://jobs.aston.ac.uk/AdvancedSearch.aspx": {
      "title": "Advanced Job Search",
      "description": "Advanced Job Search - Jobs at Aston Skip to main content Login Register Current Vacancies Working at Aston Human Resources Website Terms of Use Contact Us Cookies Accessibility Search Jobs Jobs Aston Home Login Register More ▼ Cookies This site requires the use of cookies as defined by our Terms and Conditions . \n        We have provided a detailed description of how cookies work and are used on the site . \n        To accept cookies, please click the \"Accept Cookies\" button. Accept Cookies Advanced Job Search On the jobs home page , our jobs are listed, via job type and also by campus, but you can also search by key words by typing them into the box below. Keywords Show Examples Work Location * All Work Locations Aston London Aston University John Cadbury House Aston University Main Campus Aston University Recreation Centre Other - Overseas Other - UK Category * Select all Select none Administrative & Clerical Campus Support Managerial & Professional Teaching & Research Technical Post Type All Posts Full Time Part Time Temp Minimum Salary (£) Run Search Login Please note: Javascript must be enabled to use this website. Email / Username: Password: I accept cookies Login Forgotten Details Register Find Jobs Jobs by Email Jobs by RSS Search Jobs: Search Advanced Job Search Latest Vacancies Deputy Director (Mktg & Rec) Reader in Aerospace Professor in Aerospace and Future Flight View All Vacancies Jobs Current Vacancies Working at Aston Human Resources Website Terms of Use | Contact Us | Cookies | Accessibility © 2026 Aston University"
