    "https://jobs.aston.ac.uk/display.aspx?id=1088&pid=0": {
      "title": "Contact Us",
      "description": "Contact Us - Jobs at Aston Skip to main content Login Register Current Vacancies Working at Aston Human Resources Website Terms of Use Contact Us Cookies Accessibility Search Jobs Jobs Aston Home Login Register More ▼ Cookies This site requires the use of cookies as defined by our Terms and Conditions . \n        We have provided a detailed description of how cookies work and are used on the site . \n        To accept cookies, please click the \"Accept Cookies\" button. Accept Cookies Contact Us For general enquiries please contact us at: Human Resources Aston University Aston Triangle Birmingham B4 7ET United Kingdom Tel: +44 (0)121 204 3000 Email: recruitment@aston.ac.uk https://www2.aston.ac.uk/staff-public/hr/jobs Login Please note: Javascript must be enabled to use this website. Email / Username: Password: I accept cookies Login Forgotten Details Register Find Jobs Jobs by Email Jobs by RSS Search Jobs: Search Advanced Job Search Latest Vacancies Deputy Director (Mktg & Rec) Reader in Aerospace Professor in Aerospace and Future Flight View All Vacancies Jobs Current Vacancies Working at Aston Human Resources Website Terms of Use | Contact Us | Cookies | Accessibility © 2026 Aston University"
